'''Charybdis' Mouth (Merciless)''' is the 10th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 8.1 Update|Version 8.1]] and appears every Saturday. This stage introduces the [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]]-trait Cyclone, [[Primeval Cyclone]]. Upon completion, the player has a 30% chance to unlock [[Primordial Cat (Rare Cat)|Primordial Cat]]. It is only available after clearing [[Stories of Legend]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

