==Trivia==
*Nemo comes from Latin; it means "Nobody".
*Charybdis' Mouth is based on the Greek myth of sea monsters Scylla and Charybdis, the latter being known for constantly making whirlpools and sometimes being depicted as simply a large whirlpool-like mouth.
*Prior to [[Version 11.4 Update|Version 11.4]], this stage didn't have a [[No Continues]] restriction.

